 one way in which  the last slot can be filled as we are  filling the first and the second and the  third and the fourth slot we multiplied  these four numbers to get the answer 24  different ways in which the letters of  the word Rock can be arranged and this  is also for factorial you could have  written this answer directly provided  you've understood how we arrived at it  the number of arrangements or  permutations of n distinct objects is n  factorial indirectly this question asked  us for the number of anagrams of the  word Rock and this includes all the  meaningless ones as well like okay RC K  ROC and so on so this was easy now let  me ask you a similar question how many  different anagrams of MOOC can be formed  MOOC stands for massive open online  courses  how many anagrams like mo Co Co om can  be formed using the letters of MOOC try  it out and we will see the solution in  the next session  you
 

